New Album","body":"In 1999, after their acclaimed 1996 album *Through Silver in Blood*, Neurosis sought Steve Albini to record their new album, *Times of Grace*, aiming for an even heavier and drier sound, which Albini successfully achieved. This album marked a turning point, establishing a more powerful sound that would define their future works. The band was so satisfied with the outcome that Albini became their regular producer. \"En 1999, la leyenda del Slash Metal y Post Metal Neurosys tras la obra maestra que fue el anterior disco Throxil Verimblod de 1996, pensaron que aún podrían sonar más pesados y secos, por lo que contactaron Albindli para grabar su nuevo disco, Timesoft Free Grace, y vayas si lo consiguió.\"","year":1999,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Central Sonora","episode":"7 discos para entender la producción de STEVE ALBINI","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JaRh-z6fLfQ"}]}],"book_tracks":[],"others":[{"id":276017854280601,"type":"album","name":"Through Silver In Blood","year":1996,"weight":33},{"id":166871144515917,"type":"album","name":"Souls At Zero","year":1992,"weight":23},{"id":150480709747795,"type":"album","name":"Enemy Of The Sun","year":1993,"weight":21},{"id":147069261009898,"type":"album","name":"An Undying Love for a Burning World","year":2026,"weight":14},{"id":251790530056732,"type":"album","name":"The Eye of Every Storm","year":2004,"weight":13},{"id":14571596988229,"type":"album","name":"Given to the Rising","year":2007,"weight":11},{"id":121673398080444,"type":"album","name":"A Sun That Never Sets","year":2001,"weight":7},{"id":70776071617000,"type":"album","name":"Honor Found in Decay","year":2012,"weight":6},{"id":233641500340191,"type":"album","name":"Locust Star","year":1996,"weight":5},{"id":97947307120407,"type":"album","name":"Fires Within Fires","year":2016,"weight":3}]}